<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>어린이 양육과 소그룹 교통 — 인사이트 리포트</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nanum+Myeongjo:wght@400;700;800&family=Gowun+Batang:wght@400;700&family=Gowun+Dodum&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f4ede1;
    --bg-warm: #ebe0cc;
    --paper: #fbf6ec;
    --ink: #1f1a14;
    --ink-soft: #3d342a;
    --muted: #7a6b58;
    --accent: #8b2f1e;
    --accent-soft: #c46b4a;
    --olive: #5b6342;
    --gold: #b08a3e;
    --rule: #c9bba2;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Gowun Batang', 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.85;
    font-size: 16px;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(circle at 15% 10%, rgba(139, 47, 30, 0.04) 0%, transparent 40%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 80%, rgba(91, 99, 66, 0.05) 0%, transparent 45%);
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 60px 48px;
  }

  /* ─── Header ─────────────────────────────── */
  .masthead {
    border-top: 3px double var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
    padding: 22px 0 14px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px 18px;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .masthead .pub { font-weight: 600; }
  .masthead .meta { font-style: italic; }
  .masthead .meta .dot {
    color: var(--accent);
    margin: 0 8px;
    font-size: 0.5rem;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .masthead .date { letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .masthead { font-size: 0.7rem; }
    .masthead .meta .dot { margin: 0 5px; }
  }

  .title-block {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 30px 0 60px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }
  .kicker {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  h1.main-title {
    font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  h1.main-title em {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .subtitle {
    font-family: 'Gowun Dodum', sans-serif;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .meta-strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 0;
    margin: 40px 0 70px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 22px 0;
  }
  .meta-strip > div {
    padding: 0 22px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .meta-strip > div:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .meta-label {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .meta-value {
    font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  /* ─── Section ─────────────────────────────── */
  section {
    margin-bottom: 80px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .section-num {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 4rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
    opacity: 0.85;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .section-tag {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    color: var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  h3 {
    font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin: 32px 0 14px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  p { margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .lead {
    font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    padding: 0 20px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    padding-left: 24px;
  }

  /* ─── Theme cards ─────────────────────────────── */
  .theme-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin: 30px 0;
  }
  .theme-card {
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 26px 28px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .theme-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0;
    width: 40px;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--accent);
  }
  .theme-card .num {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .theme-card h4 {
    font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .theme-card p {
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ─── Quote block ─────────────────────────────── */
  .pull-quote {
    margin: 50px 0;
    padding: 40px 50px;
    background: var(--paper);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    position: relative;
  }
  .pull-quote::before {
    content: '“';
    position: absolute;
    top: -10px;
    left: 20px;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 6rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }
  .pull-quote blockquote {
    font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .pull-quote cite {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  /* ─── Inline voice quote (from transcript) ─────────────────────────────── */
  .voice-quote {
    margin: 22px 0 22px 0;
    padding: 18px 26px 18px 32px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(176, 138, 62, 0.06) 0%, rgba(251, 246, 236, 0) 100%);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
    font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.78;
    color: var(--ink);
    position: relative;
  }
  .voice-quote::before {
    content: '\201C';
    position: absolute;
    left: 12px;
    top: 4px;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 2.6rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    line-height: 1;
    opacity: 0.55;
  }
  .voice-quote p {
    margin: 0;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .voice-quote p strong {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: rgba(176, 138, 62, 0.15);
    padding: 0 3px;
  }
  .voice-quote .attr {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-style: normal;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-align: right;
  }
  .voice-quote .attr::before {
    content: '— ';
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* ─── 5 relationships diagram ─────────────────────────────── */
  .viz-block {
    margin: 40px 0;
    padding: 40px;
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .viz-title {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .viz-title .label {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .viz-title h3 {
    margin-top: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .viz-title .caption {
    font-family: 'Gowun Dodum', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .relationship-svg {
    display: block;
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  /* ─── Comparison Table ─────────────────────────────── */
  .compare-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin: 30px 0;
  }
  table.compare {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    background: var(--paper);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
  table.compare th {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    padding: 16px 14px;
    text-align: left;
    font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  table.compare th:first-child {
    background: var(--accent);
  }
  table.compare td {
    padding: 16px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  table.compare td:first-child {
    font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--bg-warm);
    width: 130px;
  }
  table.compare tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }

  /* ─── 1/5 ratio chart ─────────────────────────────── */
  .ratio-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .ratio-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  .ratio-explainer h4 {
    font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .ratio-explainer ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .ratio-explainer li {
    padding: 10px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--rule);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .ratio-explainer li::before {
    content: '◆';
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  /* ─── Lifecycle timeline ─────────────────────────────── */
  .timeline {
    margin: 40px 0;
    position: relative;
  }
  .timeline::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 60px;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 2px;
    background: var(--rule);
  }
  .tl-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr;
    gap: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .tl-age {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-align: right;
    padding-right: 20px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .tl-age::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    right: -8px;
    top: 8px;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 3px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .tl-content {
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 18px 22px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--olive);
  }
  .tl-content h5 {
    font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .tl-content p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  /* ─── Tension / Paradox ─────────────────────────────── */
  .tension-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 60px 1fr;
    gap: 0;
    margin: 30px 0;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .tension-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .tension-vs { padding: 12px !important; }
  }
  .tension-side {
    background: var(--paper);
    padding: 28px;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .tension-side h4 {
    font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .tension-side p {
    font-size: 0.93rem;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .tension-side.left { border-right: none; border-top: 4px solid var(--accent); }
  .tension-side.right { border-left: none; border-top: 4px solid var(--olive); }
  .tension-vs {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  /* ─── Insight block ─────────────────────────────── */
  .insight-list {
    counter-reset: insight;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 30px 0;
  }
  .insight-list > li {
    counter-increment: insight;
    padding: 26px 0 26px 80px;
    position: relative;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .insight-list > li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .insight-list > li::before {
    content: counter(insight, decimal-leading-zero);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 22px;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 2.6rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .insight-list > li h4 {
    font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .insight-list > li p {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ─── Recommendations ─────────────────────────────── */
  .reco-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  .reco-card {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--paper) 0%, var(--bg-warm) 100%);
    padding: 26px 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    position: relative;
  }
  .reco-card .icon {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--olive);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .reco-card h5 {
    font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .reco-card p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ─── Footer ─────────────────────────────── */
  footer {
    margin-top: 80px;
    padding-top: 30px;
    border-top: 3px double var(--ink);
    text-align: center;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  /* ─── Responsive ─────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .container { padding: 30px 22px; }
    .meta-strip { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .meta-strip > div { padding: 12px; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .tl-item { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }
    .tl-age { text-align: left; padding-right: 0; padding-left: 30px; }
    .tl-age::after { left: 0; right: auto; }
    .timeline::before { left: 6px; }
    .pull-quote { padding: 30px 28px; }
    .pull-quote blockquote { font-size: 1.1rem; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.7rem; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

  <!-- ═══════════════ Masthead ═══════════════ -->
  <div class="masthead">
    <span class="pub">Ministry Notes · 어린이 양육 교통</span>
    <span class="meta">권역별 교통<span class="dot">●</span>사무동 4층 단기교육실<span class="dot">●</span>11인 참석</span>
    <span class="date">2026.05.23 (토) · 14:00–16:00</span>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══════════════ Title ═══════════════ -->
  <div class="title-block">
    <div class="kicker">A Field Report</div>
    <h1 class="main-title">아이는 한 가정이 아니라,<br><em>온 교회가</em> 함께 키운다</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
      세종 · 안양 · 대전 · 천안 교회 형제자매들의 어린이 소그룹 교통 기록.<br>
      양육의 한계, 관계 맺음, 그리고 가정이 열리는 길에 대한 정리.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══════════════ Meta Strip ═══════════════ -->
  <div class="meta-strip">
    <div>
      <div class="meta-label">Topic</div>
      <div class="meta-value">어린이 소그룹 · 양육</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="meta-label">Participants</div>
      <div class="meta-value">11명 (다지역)</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="meta-label">Duration</div>
      <div class="meta-value">2시간 (14–16시)</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="meta-label">Core Question</div>
      <div class="meta-value">어떻게 보존할 것인가</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══════════════ SECTION 1: 대화의 전체 흐름 ═══════════════ -->
  <section>
    <div class="section-num">01</div>
    <div class="section-tag">Conversation Map</div>
    <h2>한 자리에 펼쳐진 여섯 결</h2>

    <p class="lead">
      양육은 한 갈래 문제로 풀리지 않는다. 부모 개인의 한계 고백에서 시작해, 교회 시스템의 부재, 해외 교회 모델의 관찰,
      봉사·환경·시설의 실질, 운영의 노하우까지 여섯 결이 동시에 펼쳐졌다.
      표면의 질문은 “어린이 소그룹을 어떻게 운영할 것인가”였지만, 그 아래에 흐르는 진짜 질문은 하나다 —
      <strong>우리 아이를 교회 안에 어떻게 머무르게 할 것인가.</strong>
    </p>

    <div class="voice-quote">
      <p>이거 어떻게 주님께 구해야 되는지… 환경적인 요인들이 많다 보니까 어느 순간 막 막혀버린 거예요. 그런데 요즘 많이 와닿는 거는 <strong>기도가 참 부족했다. 내가 감춰진 만나를 참 먹지를 못했구나</strong>라는 생각이 들더라고요. 주님의 긍휼을 구하는 기도를 안 하면 진짜 내 마음대로 되는 건 정말 없는 것 같습니다.</p>
      <span class="attr">큰아이 사춘기로 힘들어하는 어머니</span>
